WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.033 --> 00:00:01.701
-Guys, finally it is Tuesday.

00:00:01.701 --> 00:00:02.767
It's time for "WeTweet."

00:00:02.767 --> 00:00:04.000
Here we go.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.033
-♪ WeTweet ♪

00:00:08.868 --> 00:00:10.167
♪ WeTweet ♪

00:00:11.667 --> 00:00:13.400
-Welcome to "WeTweet."

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:15.133
This is where we, as a group,

00:00:15.133 --> 00:00:17.667
decide something that
we should post on Twitter.

00:00:17.667 --> 00:00:19.067
I'm going to show you
five different tweets,

00:00:19.067 --> 00:00:19.934
and we're all
going to vote on

00:00:19.934 --> 00:00:21.501
whether you like
each one or not.

00:00:21.501 --> 00:00:23.801
You all have your voting
clickers at your seats.

00:00:23.801 --> 00:00:26.033
You can all vote -- Yeah.

00:00:26.033 --> 00:00:27.434
That's probably yours, yeah.

00:00:27.434 --> 00:00:29.868
[ Laughter ]
You can vote for all of them.

00:00:29.868 --> 00:00:31.100
You can vote for none of them.

00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:32.601
Whatever you want.
I just want you to have fun.

00:00:32.601 --> 00:00:33.901
We're going to see
the results live.

00:00:33.901 --> 00:00:35.033
Tariq, Roots?

00:00:35.033 --> 00:00:36.167
Tariq, you have your clicker?

00:00:36.167 --> 00:00:37.767
-Yeah, I'm done already,
thanks.

00:00:37.767 --> 00:00:38.934
-No, no,
we didn't even start --

00:00:38.934 --> 00:00:40.567
We didn't even start
the game yet.

00:00:40.567 --> 00:00:42.901
-Wait, what?
-We didn't start the game yet.

00:00:42.901 --> 00:00:45.367
Don't vote on Tariq's --
-Can you unvote?

00:00:45.367 --> 00:00:47.467
-No, you can't
unvote either, no.

00:00:47.467 --> 00:00:48.901
Whatever tweet gets the most
likes,

00:00:48.901 --> 00:00:50.801
we will tweet it out live on
the show on a commercial break

00:00:50.801 --> 00:00:53.000
so you can all like it
and "wetweet" it.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:55.501
[ Audience ahs ]
Yeah, it's a shared experience.

00:00:55.501 --> 00:00:56.834
You guys ready for this?

00:00:56.834 --> 00:00:57.901
[ Cheers ]

00:00:57.901 --> 00:00:59.400
Our first tweet is...

00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:04.467
[ Laughter ]

00:01:06.868 --> 00:01:08.934
-I didn't like that one.
-You didn't like it?

00:01:08.934 --> 00:01:12.734
-Nope.
-I think it's alright.

00:01:12.734 --> 00:01:14.434
I mean, I kind of get it.
-I dig it.

00:01:14.434 --> 00:01:16.834
-You dig it?

00:01:16.834 --> 00:01:17.934
Alright. The votes are in.

00:01:17.934 --> 00:01:20.400
Let's see the results here.

00:01:20.400 --> 00:01:23.467
Ooh. Wow.
[ Sad tuba ]

00:01:23.467 --> 00:01:24.734
Very honest audience.

00:01:24.734 --> 00:01:26.534
They did not enjoy that one.

00:01:26.534 --> 00:01:28.000
[ Laughter ]
They did not like that one.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:29.634
It's okay.
We have a couple more.

00:01:29.634 --> 00:01:30.734
Here we go.

00:01:30.734 --> 00:01:32.234
-We're warming up.
-Yeah, we're warming up.

00:01:32.234 --> 00:01:38.033
This next one is...

00:01:38.033 --> 00:01:40.267
-Thinker.

00:01:40.267 --> 00:01:43.100
-I can tell by people's eyes
that they're saying, "No."

00:01:43.100 --> 00:01:46.267
[ Laughter ]
They're masked.

00:01:46.267 --> 00:01:47.634
And they're just looking
at me like --

00:01:47.634 --> 00:01:51.200
[ Laughter ]

00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:52.367
I can tell they pressed no.

00:01:52.367 --> 00:01:53.601
I'm going to say this one is --

00:01:53.601 --> 00:01:56.400
What was the last one,
how many no's?

00:01:56.400 --> 00:01:58.400
76 likes?

00:01:58.400 --> 00:02:00.200
So I'm going to say
this one is probably

00:02:00.200 --> 00:02:03.367
in the 150 range of "no."

00:02:03.367 --> 00:02:05.100
[ Laughter ]
-Ah.

00:02:05.100 --> 00:02:07.968
-This might be one of
the worst ones ever.

00:02:07.968 --> 00:02:09.167
Let's see the results.

00:02:10.400 --> 00:02:12.267
[ Sad tuba ]
Yeah. Very close. I felt it.

00:02:12.267 --> 00:02:13.667
I knew it.
I could tell.

00:02:13.667 --> 00:02:15.667
They looked at me like,
"No, Jimmy, not going to do it.

00:02:15.667 --> 00:02:17.767
I'm going to let you drown a
little bit, then I'll save you."

00:02:17.767 --> 00:02:19.734
I go, "Alright,
teach me a lesson."

00:02:19.734 --> 00:02:21.033
How about this next one here?

00:02:30.067 --> 00:02:32.300
-Yes, you do.
You know you do.

00:02:32.300 --> 00:02:36.234
-I do, but is that more fact
than it is funny?

00:02:36.234 --> 00:02:37.567
-It's a fun fact.

00:02:37.567 --> 00:02:40.267
-I always start
at chapter four.

00:02:40.267 --> 00:02:41.634
-What?
-I don't want to hear

00:02:41.634 --> 00:02:44.601
about their childhood,
and when they discovered music.

00:02:44.601 --> 00:02:46.033
-I don't want
to hear about that either.

00:02:46.033 --> 00:02:47.634
"My mom was born --"
I go, "Hey, if I want to read

00:02:47.634 --> 00:02:49.501
about your mom,
I would get her biography."

00:02:49.501 --> 00:02:50.801
[ Laughter ]

00:02:50.801 --> 00:02:53.234
I think we're riding
this train together.

00:02:53.234 --> 00:02:55.801
And I think that we're 50/50
on this.

00:02:55.801 --> 00:02:58.767
I think we're split down
the middle, if I'm being nice.

00:02:58.767 --> 00:03:01.868
Let's see the results.

00:03:01.868 --> 00:03:03.267
What?

00:03:04.501 --> 00:03:06.934
I feel like I don't know
you anymore.

00:03:06.934 --> 00:03:08.701
What happened to us?

00:03:08.701 --> 00:03:10.234
We had something.

00:03:10.234 --> 00:03:11.834
-Wait, you didn't want them
to like that?

00:03:11.834 --> 00:03:13.434
-No, I like that they liked it.

00:03:13.434 --> 00:03:14.868
I just didn't expect them
to like it.

00:03:14.868 --> 00:03:16.868
I liked it.

00:03:16.868 --> 00:03:18.534
I mean, we both did
the same thing.

00:03:18.534 --> 00:03:21.968
I just thought the numbers
would be more even.

00:03:21.968 --> 00:03:23.434
This one's pretty good.

00:03:25.334 --> 00:03:27.334
What do you think about this one
before I say it?

00:03:27.334 --> 00:03:31.400
-Hated it.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:31.400 --> 00:03:32.434
-Next up...

00:03:38.167 --> 00:03:40.267
-I always say that.
-Oh.

00:03:40.267 --> 00:03:41.567
Why not, man?

00:03:41.567 --> 00:03:43.367
I don't know if I'm happy,
but just do it,

00:03:43.367 --> 00:03:44.868
and you probably end up happy.

00:03:44.868 --> 00:03:47.367
I think this one's up there.
-This is the winner.

00:03:47.367 --> 00:03:49.434
-The winner? The last one was
pretty good too.

00:03:49.434 --> 00:03:50.701
I think this one is going
to be the winner.

00:03:50.701 --> 00:03:53.100
Let's see the results
on this one right here.

00:03:53.100 --> 00:03:57.734
Oh, yeah!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:57.734 --> 00:04:02.200
Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
That's a good one.

00:04:02.200 --> 00:04:03.534
But this last one
is pretty good, too.

00:04:03.534 --> 00:04:04.734
But that one's going to be
the winner, I think.

00:04:04.734 --> 00:04:06.968
But this last one's good.
Check this one out.

00:04:10.567 --> 00:04:13.601
[ Laughter ]

00:04:13.601 --> 00:04:16.434
I mean, it kind of
just goes in the floor.

00:04:16.434 --> 00:04:17.801
The floor eats it.

00:04:17.801 --> 00:04:20.133
-You find it months later.
-You find it years later.

00:04:20.133 --> 00:04:21.367
Dried.

00:04:21.367 --> 00:04:24.033
"Honey, did you drop this bead?"
-Right.

00:04:24.033 --> 00:04:26.267
-Yeah, I liked that one but I
don't know if it's gonna be --

00:04:26.267 --> 00:04:28.067
What was the last record?

00:04:28.067 --> 00:04:29.267
-184.
-184.

00:04:29.267 --> 00:04:31.067
It's got to beat 184.
It's gotta be a good one.

00:04:31.067 --> 00:04:32.267
I don't know
if it's going to happen.

00:04:32.267 --> 00:04:34.868
Let's see the results.

00:04:34.868 --> 00:04:36.734
No. It did not win!

00:04:36.734 --> 00:04:38.334
[ Dinging ]
It was high, but did not win.

00:04:38.334 --> 00:04:40.767
The winner was
tweet number four.

00:04:40.767 --> 00:04:43.133
[ Dinging ]

00:04:43.133 --> 00:04:46.067
You should still clap
your hands just in case.

00:04:46.067 --> 00:04:48.234
I will post this during
the commercial break.

00:04:48.234 --> 00:04:49.534
If you see it on your feed,

00:04:49.534 --> 00:04:51.267
give it a like,
give it a wetweet.

00:04:51.267 --> 00:04:52.968
Why not? Enjoy.

